      "message": "**Major:** Agreed: since 644811, `list_change_comments` on master lists each thread with its `patch_set` and its `unresolved` flag, and each comment with its `in_reply_to`. Gerrit accepts a reply only on the patch set of the comment it answers, so the `patch_set` this change adds per comment equals the thread\u0027s (`CommentsUtil.ensureValidInReplyTo`). The change also conflicts with master in `gerrit_mcp_server/main.py` and `docs/available_tools.md`, so please abandon it.",
